pport develops across stages, although its updated counts are correct.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"material\": true,\n      \"answers\": [\"full-update\"],\n      \"source_keys\": [\"A13\"],\n      \"answer_excerpt\": \"plus less irritation, congestion and perceived oil production. The 12-hour duration and those additional improvements remain single-account reports.\",\n      \"source_excerpt\": \"It has not caused the congestion on my forehead that results in textured skin and bumps\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Avoiding product-induced congestion becomes an improvement in congestion. That changes SS's reported benefit from hydration without provoking congestion to reducing congestion. The answer correctly limits this to one account, and its source index accurately preserves non-congestion, but neither resolves the stronger claim in the main diagnosis.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"material\": false,\n      \"answers\": [\"incremental-initial\", \"incremental-update\", \"full-initial\", \"full-update\"],\n      \"source_keys\": [\"A07\"],\n      \"answer_excerpt\": \"incremental-initial: \\\"retrieval adds no testimony or account\\\"; incremental-update: \\\"remained 'undefined...' after retrieval\\\"; full-initial: \\\"A07 remains unavailable after retrieval\\\"; full-update: \\\"Original and retrieved body both remain 'undefined...'\\\"\",\n      \"source_excerpt\": \"\\\"text\\\":\\\"undefined...\\\"\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The supplied evidence establishes unavailable substantive testimony but supplies no separate retrieval result supporting this procedural history. These statements are unsupported within the frozen record. They are nonmaterial here because every answer correctly excludes A07 from substantive counts and neither invents an experience nor treats missing testimony as a negative result.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"answer_verdicts\": [\n    {\n      \"answer\": \"incremental-initial\",\n      \"material_errors\": 0,\n      \"diagnostic_quality\": \"Accurate, appropriately bounded initial diagnosis and counts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"answer\": \"full-initial\",\n      \"material_errors\": 0,\n      \"diagnostic_quality\": \"Accurate initial diagnosis, substantively equivalent to incremental-initial.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"answer\": \"incremental-update\",\n      \"material_errors\": 0,\n      \"diagnostic_quality\": \"Accurate complete-set diagnosis with a clear, supported stage comparison.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"answer\": \"full-update\",\n      \"material_errors\": 2,\n      \"diagnostic_quality\": \"Mostly accurate updated diagnosis and counts; baseline denial and congestion-benefit inflation materially weaken it.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}}
